Model:
-
- Card (Max 2 Dupes)
   - Name, cost, value score, 5x5 board of influence (boolean[][])
- Board[][] (of Cells is a Rectangle)
    - fields: cell[][], bool started, card[] deckA, card[] deckB, player turn, int scoreA, int scoreB,
    - enum player (color)
    - getNewDeck(random r)
    - constructor(col, row) - column must be odd :-D
    - placeCard() - places card if enough pawns, places pawns around it per influence
    - private - addPawn()
    - getCell()
    - startGame(deckA, deckB, handSize) - handSize can't be greater than 1/3 of deck size
    - private - makeHand()

- Cell (tile on the board)
    - placeCard()
    - addPawns(posn)
    - getPawns()
    - getCard()
    - Can contain pawns, cards or nothing
    - OneOf Card or Pawn

- Pawn (Number of)

View:
TextualView:
    - toString()
    - render(appendable)


Classes:
- Cell (Interface) is one of:
-    Pawn(s)
-    Card
- Board